# C++ and WebAssembly

Component names connect values, events, and results. Slamhaus derives the DOM
identifiers, module URL, export list, and argument conversion.

```slam-ui
Column Calculator() {
  TextInput Name("Player name", placeholder: "Ada");
  Button GreetButton("Greet") => Greet(Name) -> Greeting;
  Output Greeting("Ready");
  Number Left("Left", value: 2);
  Number Right("Right", value: 3);
  Button AddButton("Add") => Add(Left, Right) -> Answer;
  Output Answer("Ready");
};
```

```cpp wasm
auto Greet(FString Name) -> FString {
  return "Hello, " + Name + "!";
}

auto Add(int32 A, int32 B) -> int32 {
  return A + B;
}
```
